    <briefdescription>
<para>For each object containing debug info, installs JITLink passes to synthesize a debug object and then register it via the GDB JIT-registration interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Currently <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_mach_o" kindref="compound">MachO</ref> only. For <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_e_l_f" kindref="compound">ELF</ref> use <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_debug_object_manager_plugin" kindref="compound">DebugObjectManagerPlugin</ref>. These two plugins will be merged in the near future. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
